playable races, each with wildly different theme and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technocracy - some descendants of the original humans, mostly replaced with AI, it is a living machine now. Their focus is on progressing towards higher-tier units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomass - evolution gone wrong - this race is driven by photosynthesis, mutation, acid, and claws. Their focus is on overwhelming opponents with large numbers of units.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Economy And &quot;Streaming&quot; Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/9ee40a7891961af65642b43a7944967b.avif?t=1769693246\" width=1230 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue-up buildings, and required goods will be delivered when available. The resources are transported by automated trucks - it is not just a number in the gui.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factories refine resources into other goods, or produce units, indefinitely. You set it up once, and it will continue to work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UW replaces technology tree with acquiring or refining new resources. Researching upgrades for your units requires continuous delivery of goods. The upgrades have ramp-up phase, and will slowly diminish without supplies.</p>","developers":["Tom\u00e1\u0161 Mal\u00fd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/header.jpg?t=1769693246","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64, 4 threads<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.2, vram 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is experimental</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64, 8 threads<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.2, vram 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is experimental</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/522494445/c43cb722056109bbbf87229733ab8aeae99ff368/1769656242/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769657256","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/522494445/c43cb722056109bbbf87229733ab8aeae99ff368/1769656242/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769657256","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/522494445/c43cb722056109bbbf87229733ab8aeae99ff368/1769656242/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769657256","id":257275003,"name":"Bug squashing","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275003/bcf42794083a10ec033f08817528e1d063960bf9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769657256"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/245175217/a33752bb7881fe743405de884bcbc4cc82ec4b00/1769654972/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769657256","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/245175217/a33752bb7881fe743405de884bcbc4cc82ec4b00/1769654972/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769657256","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/245175217/a33752bb7881fe743405de884bcbc4cc82ec4b00/1769654972/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769657256","id":257274999,"name":"Attack from two sides","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257274999/e67b5d45bcc3c3402a3fa3666a9d0c2e3be811c1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769657256"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.a